---
pre-compare: sort
---
// `summarize` emits groups in an unspecified order, so the baseline would be
// flaky without help. `pre-compare: sort` sorts both the baseline and the
// actual output before comparing, which keeps the ordering requirement out of
// the pipeline under test. Records stay intact: whole events sort as units.
from_file f"{env("TENZIR_INPUTS")}/events.ndjson" {
  read_ndjson
}
summarize severity, events=count()
